     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nHi all,</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\njust in case you may not have noted: the brand-new paper by Kellner et al., which officially introduces the Bayesian sister package of unmarked, ubms, is out now in the latest issue of MEE.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\nBest regards  --- Marc<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449434615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z3XzEz6HywF_eMUraubr8\">https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777</a></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"width:100%;margin-top:16px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:800px;min-width:424px\">\r\n<table role=\"presentation\" style=\"padding:12px 36px 12px 12px;width:100%;border-width:1px;border-style:solid;border-color:rgb(200,200,200);border-radius:2px\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"border-spacing:0px\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<td>\r\n<div style=\"margin-right:12px;min-height:160px;overflow:hidden;width:240px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449434615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z3XzEz6HywF_eMUraubr8\"><img alt=\"\" style=\"display:block\" width=\"121\" height=\"160\" src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/1ZRO5-wU0MHuC3x5IhC3ubFQcqCcvSweKBaS0P8m0rbGlcbKUSdxRWLjTK7H7zeo1Y9UHH7GvpNWx3iMBR8bGRIEvmN2obZ0JlEceWAtjB9VvpHHNMLPK4Mv5IhxvLn-uG_UtP4ZXaoFgmHFLq1l4gbvARxygvdTDWa-dig1SZkWTA=s0-d-e1-ft#https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/cms/asset/4a3cb513-a10e-4bad-91bb-9792862d41bd/mee3.v13.3.cover.jpg\"></a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width:100%\">\r\n<div style=\"font-size:21px;font-weight:300;margin-right:8px;font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP Light&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px\">\r\n<a href=\"https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777\" style=\"text-decoration:none;color:var(--themePrimary)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com/doi/epdf/10.1111/2041-210X.13777&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449434615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3Z3XzEz6HywF_eMUraubr8\">ubms: An R package for fitting hierarchical occupancy and N‐mixture abundance\r\n models in a Bayesian framework - Kellner - 2022 - Methods in Ecology and Evolution - Wiley Online Library</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;max-height:100px;color:rgb(102,102,102);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif;margin-bottom:12px;margin-right:8px;overflow:hidden\">\r\nObtaining unbiased estimates of wildlife distribution and abundance is an important objective in research and management. Occupancy and N-mixture abundance models, which correct for imperfect detection, are commonly used for this purpose.</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-size:14px;font-weight:400;color:rgb(166,166,166);font-family:&quot;wf_segoe-ui_normal&quot;,&quot;Segoe UI&quot;,&quot;Segoe WP&quot;,Tahoma,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n<a href=\"http://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792449434615000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1B3L_kjwxLj4OVT3XI9VIs\">besjournals.onlinelibrary.wiley.com</a></div>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<br>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:Tahoma,Geneva,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n"
